    desc = Flux + dotwork LoRA — stippling with dot-density gradients for mandalas and geometry.
    hint = flux dotwork LoRA with precise stippling and dot-density gradients
  SDXL Watercolor
    desc = SDXL + watercolor-style tattoo LoRA — flowing ink splashes, soft bleeds, translucent washes.
